sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant S as Server (API)
    participant AI as OpenRouter (LLM)
    participant DB as Supabase DB

    U->>F: Enter Subject Name (e.g. "React")
    F->>S: POST /api/generate-roadmap
    S->>AI: Prompt: Generate DAG JSON for "React"
    AI-->>S: Return JSON (Nodes, Edges, Dependencies)
    S->>DB: Insert Subject record
    S->>DB: Bulk insert Topics
    S->>DB: Bulk insert Dependencies
    S->>S: Run updateUnlockedTopics()
    S-->>F: Return success & newSubjectId
    F->>U: Redirect to Subject Graph
